## 6. Completion checklist

- [ ] Phase 1: `quorum-restore.sh` run on master03; API writable
- [ ] master01 rebuilt, CSRs approved, etcd member started
- [ ] master02 rebuilt, CSRs approved, etcd member started
- [ ] `etcdctl member list` = 3 started
- [ ] All cluster operators Available / not Degraded
- [ ] `oc get mcp master` 3/3
- [ ] HAProxy backends re-enabled (6443, 22623)
- [ ] Data-loss spot check done; missing objects re-applied
- [ ] New etcd backup taken and copied off-cluster
- [ ] ISO/ignition files removed from shared storage (ignition contains cluster credentials)
- [ ] Incident record updated with timeline, Raft index/data-loss notes, deviations

